    "note": "The Odyssey confirmed $90M in week two (-27%) — better than Oppenheimer's own -44% second-weekend drop, now $304.1M domestic after 10 days and $666.7M globally, tracking toward $1B by frame 5 or 6. Toy Story 5 crossed $1.025B globally. Spider-Man: Brand New Day confirmed a record-shattering $75M Thursday preview haul (topping Endgame's $60M all-time mark) and is now tracking for $345M+ domestic — a potential run at Endgame's $365.1M all-time opening-weekend record."
